  "setupTourBody": "We’ll walk through the real Today, Plan and Journey screens and point out what each part does. It takes about a minute, and you can skip it any time.",
  "setupTestBody": "Open a selected app and look for Daylock’s lock screen. Return here to see the result. Also open it normally from Home after leaving Daylock in the background: this test confirms only one opening. This uses your real Freedom conditions and never completes a goal for you.",
  "setupFirstCommitmentBody": "Today’s plan is already locked. Your first new commitment goes into tomorrow’s real plan. Apps unlock when all eligible commitments are complete, Freedom Time is reached, and tomorrow’s plan is committed. An empty day does not earn Freedom.",
  "setupAccessibilityOemHelp": "On Xiaomi / HyperOS, Samsung and Pixel, settings names vary. Choose this installed Daylock app’s service. If “Restricted settings” appears, review App info → Allow restricted settings only for a build you trust. If the service is enabled but disconnected, toggle it off and on once.",
  "setupAccessibilityExplain": "Daylock detects when a selected app opens and can show its lock screen or return Home. Screen contents are never read. Access is optional and can be revoked in Android Settings.",
  "setupBlockingOptional": "App blocking is optional. Without it, Daylock still plans your days and tracks your commitments. You can turn it on later in Settings.",
  "setupXiaomiBody": "HyperOS can pause Daylock in the background even while Accessibility shows enabled. A test inside Daylock may work while opening Instagram from Home does not.\n\nIn this app’s App info:\n• Autostart: on\n• Battery saver (or Power): No restrictions\n• Other permissions → Display pop-up windows while running in the background: allow\n\nSwiping Daylock away in Recents or using “Clean” can still stop blocking. If that happens, Today shows a warning: turn Daylock off and on in Accessibility.\n\nUse the settings for this installed Daylock app; Daylock Dev and the Play version have separate settings. Daylock cannot read these Xiaomi choices. Confirm them yourself below, then test normal app openings too.",
